  "explanation": "The question asks which award Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII received. Two distinct referents are identified:\n\n1. In **Document d1**, it is stated that **Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII (born 1972)** received the **Order of Culture** in 2011 for his contributions to kabuki and Japanese culture. This is directly supported by D1S8 and corroborated by D1S13 and D1S15.\n\n2. In **Document d2**, it is stated that **Nakamura Kenzaburo XVII (born 1945)** received the **Grand Cross of the Civil Order of Alfonso XII** in 2001. This is directly supported by D2S8 and corroborated by D2S16 and D2S19.\n\nThese are two separate individuals with the same name and profession, each receiving a distinct award. Both awards are explicitly attributed to their respective referents in the original sources. Therefore, both answers are valid and should be retained."
}
